            <li><strong>Primary Entity:</strong> Ingested Knowledge Artifact (${file.mimeType.split("/")[1] || "data"})</li>
            <li><strong>Reinforcing Dynamics (R):</strong> Knowledge absorption accelerates heuristic adaptation rate (+2.3x)</li>
            <li><strong>Balancing Feedback (B):</strong> High variety stream is filtered through automatic non-tech UI abstractions</li>
            <li><strong>Zero-Friction Transformation:</strong> Ready to map into Causal Loop Canvas and generate 1-click bundle</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      `;
      // Push into simulator
      if (metasystemLinkInput) metasystemLinkInput.value = `Google Drive: ${file.name}`;
    });
  }

  // Synthesis Action
  synthesizeBtn?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    const inputVal = metasystemLinkInput?.value.trim() || (selectedFile ? selectedFile.name : "Active Research Repo");
    if (!synthesizerOutput) return;

    const newBlueprint = document.createElement("div");
    newBlueprint.className = "blueprint-card fade-in";
    newBlueprint.innerHTML = `
